{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqqv4ix36dd","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"search-context daemon wedge root cause: rerank sidecar cold-start spawn storm","summary":"SPEC IS INCOMPLETE: the /subconscious/search-context event-loop wedge was NOT slowness in buildGraph or embed — it was a rerank sidecar cold-start spawn storm. The multi-round agentic search-context loop (lib/subconscious/index.js runAgenticContextSearches) calls the cross-encoder rerank() once per round (rerank is ON by default in memory-search.js). rerank's sidecar is spawned lazily on first call; the child writes its PID file only after Node boots + server.listen fires, and its unix-socket/named-pipe does not accept until the ~80MB cross-encoder finishes loading (seconds). The old spawnSidecar() guard deduped solely on the PID file, so EVERY rerank() failure during that cold window spawned ANOTHER sidecar. A few back-to-back search-context calls (each several rounds) detonated one cold start into N concurrent model-loading processes that saturated the CPU and starved the daemon's own event loop — /health stopped responding and later calls hung past their socket timeout (event-loop block, not slowness). Onboard was unaffected because it uses the eagerly-spawned EMBED sidecar (single instance), not lazy rerank. Fix: in-process spawn cooldown latch (_lastSpawnAt/SPAWN_COOLDOWN_MS=30s) in lib/rerank.js AND lib/embed.js caps spawns to one per cooldown regardless of PID-file timing; plus server.on('error') EADDRINUSE guard in lib/rerank-server.js + lib/embed-server.js so a bind-race loser exits before loading a model; rerank-server no longer unconditionally unlinks a live winner socket. Regression: test/subconscious-search-context-wedge.test.js (24-call rerank burst spawns at most once; 6 rapid search-context calls keep a 25ms event-loop probe responsive). Implication for task #4 (adding an LLM call into this same loop): any new per-round sidecar/subprocess MUST carry the same single-spawn cooldown discipline or it will reintroduce the wedge.","category":null,"tags":[],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-23T16:32:30.663Z","vec":[-0.10140372067689896,-0.025802478194236755,0.010411720722913742,0.04867906868457794,0.08872698247432709,-0.051224235445261,-0.0606590211391449,0.03139286860823631,0.057223811745643616,-0.00785546749830246,0.017273953184485435,0.05773431807756424,0.06418521702289581,-0.07708453387022018,0.01175630558282137,-0.013545626774430275,0.08238168805837631,0.00945507362484932,-0.05288618430495262,-0.0202274639159441,-0.006428020540624857,-0.042900338768959045,-0.007543783634901047,-0.026533570140600204,-0.058548711240291595,0.0023321188054978848,-0.07082847505807877,-0.025506652891635895,0.011908200569450855,0.0020395980682224035,0.04999484866857529,0.061953019350767136,-0.05713683366775513,0.012264530174434185,-0.00404518423601985,0.09721124172210693,0.011439399793744087,-0.03758813813328743,-0.10280933976173401,0.009860266931355,0.05161864310503006,0.03827685862779617,-0.05448455363512039,-0.007603374309837818,0.021315746009349823,-0.06895022094249725,-0.11913156509399414,-0.05842439830303192,-0.059634555131196976,-0.09642723202705383,-0.061987657099962234,-0.03640974685549736,-0.02358783781528473,0.06531741470098495,0.03084171935915947,0.01602388173341751,0.003842158941552043,0.037004634737968445,0.004453099798411131,0.035159897059202194,0.01727140322327614,0.0008162656449712813,-0.029451221227645874,-0.04207534343004227,0.10108737647533417,-0.0003401668509468436,0.033353157341480255,-0.030333464965224266,0.05526065081357956,0.013572713360190392,0.07461743801832199,0.03184840828180313,-0.08569366484880447,-0.04838074371218681,-0.010310009121894836,0.033979013562202454,0.02436065673828125,-0.0014623841270804405,-0.02387145161628723,-0.09312904626131058,-0.051324665546417236,-0.027952179312705994,-0.012266443111002445,-0.03333073481917381,-0.04149816557765007,-0.03060644119977951,0.08023589104413986,-0.03505123406648636,0.09164519608020782,0